OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHorses, walkers and cyclists join
OL,4,Aroad safety ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FAaron Turner, 22, of Craylands Square
OL,7,Fin Swanscombe, has appeared in court
OL,8,Fcharged with two counts of causing
OL,9,Fdeath by dangerous driving in
OL,10,Fconnection with the incident.
OL,12,FParticipants on Saturday were
OL,13,Faccompanied by a police escort and
OL,14,Fstopped for the minute's silence where
OL,15,Fthe cyclists died.
